concept:australian-capital-territory-planning-and-land-management-amendment-act-2018-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Transitional—duties of accountable authority"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of sections 39, 42 and 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the Authority is the accountable authority in relation to the reporting period (within the meaning of that Act) for the Authority that ends immediately before this item commences." ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of sections 39, 42 and 46 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the Authority is the accountable authority in relation to the reporting period (within the meaning of that Act) for the Authority that ends immediately before this item commences."@en ;
