doc:sch-1-sec-7-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 Transitional—things done by, or in relation to, the" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "accountable authority Anything done by, or in relation to, the Chief Executive as the accountable authority for the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013) before the commencement of this item has effect after that commencement as if the thing had been done by, or in relation to, the Authority as the accountable authority. Note: For example, an instruction given by the Chief Executive under subsection 20A(1) of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 before commencement will be treated after commencement as if it had been given by the Authority.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 6 December 2017 House of Representatives on 9 May 2018]  (262/17)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer .